      "fontWeight": "400",
      "color": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "text": "> Devs got agents that ship real code. Product is still waiting for its own.",
      "fontSize": "52px",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "text": "One system, three layers.",
