      "text": "> Devs got agents that ship real code. Product is still waiting for its own. EVERY CRAFT GOT ITS AI-NATIVE HOME CODE Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, v0, Lovable AGENT-RUN DESIGN Figma, Framer AGENT-ASSISTED DOCS Notion AI, Gemini AGENT-ASSISTED WORK Linear, Jira SYSTEM OF RECORD DECISIONS heads, threads, sc heads, threads, scrollback NO HOME So teams build on gut. WHAT TEAMS SAY “So why did we decide on X? Cue hours of finding that Slack conversation from months ago.” TOP-VOTED THREAD, r/ProductManagement, 480 POINTS WHAT IT COSTS 80% of shipped features are rarely or never used. The building was ",
