      ],
      "text": "Evidence, not claims. Every link here opens a page you can check without an account: run the teardown on your own PRD, read the dated log of what shipped. Supaprod has run on its own loop since June 2026. On the record GRADED VERDICTS REAL DECISIONS PUBLIC TEARDOWNS DATED SHIPPING LOG A public teardown, no signup → What shipped this week → Verdicts take weeks, so the record accrues in calendar time. What nobody can reconstruct afterwards is what you believed before the outcome landed. A forecast leaves no trace unless something wrote it down at the moment you decided. A competitor starting nex",
